Of course
I said no

130
00:08:19,422 --> 00:08:21,902
You know you
gotta do it， man

131
00:08:21,942 --> 00:08:23,221
I can't do that
come on

132
00:08:23,261 --> 00:08:24,701
No， you have to

133
00:08:24,741 --> 00:08:25,621
If someone
asks you to do…

134
00:08:25,661 --> 00:08:27,140
What's
wrong with you？

135
00:08:27,180 --> 00:08:28,340
Excuse me？

136
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:30,340
Shh

137
